1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,800
SkillProofAI helps job seekers move from listing skills to showing evidence.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:09,000
An evidence-based career intelligence platform
turns a resume and target role into clear next steps.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Candidates often wonder: does my resume demonstrate
what this role asks for?

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:31,000
A keyword match cannot answer that.
SkillProofAI focuses on the proof a resume contains.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,500
Choose a role, add a PDF resume,
and paste the job requirements.

6
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:47,000
This uses a clearly fictional sample.
Selectable PDF text is processed in memory.

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:55,500
The coverage indicator summarizes evidence
across the role's requirements.

8
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:06,000
It is not a hiring score or prediction.
Results depend on this particular resume.

9
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Each classification can be traced to resume text.
A demonstrated result has a direct mention and support.

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Partial means more proof would help.
Not evidenced means no reliable anchor was found here.

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:37,500
For gaps, the app suggests focused
two-day portfolio sprints with concrete deliverables.

12
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:47,000
Build a project, document the work,
and strengthen the evidence.

13
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Interview preparation is tied to the same skills.
Practice explaining real decisions and outcomes.

14
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Connect context, action, result,
and what you learned.

15
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Signed-in users can save analysis history
and export a PDF evidence report.

16
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:17,000
React and Vite, FastAPI and Python,
SQLite, PyMuPDF, and ReportLab.

17
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:25,000
SkillProofAI helps students see what their resume proves
and what evidence to build next.

18
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:34,000
Show your skills. Strengthen your evidence.
Build your future.
